00-sources/*.pdf
00-sources/originals/*.pdf
*.zip
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# 00-sources/md/ and 00-sources/pages/ ARE tracked, by decision 2026-08-14.
# Both are byte-identical across rebuilds, so they diff meaningfully and a
# reader can see a source without building anything.
#
# These two are not, and cannot be:
#
#   source.db     182 MB. GitHub refuses any single file over 100 MiB, so this
#                 cannot be pushed without Git LFS. Rebuild it in ~20 seconds:
#                     python tools/build_source_corpus.py
#   page-images/  a render cache, filled on request at ~1-3 MB per page. It
#                 would grow without limit and holds nothing that is not in
#                 the PDFs already.
00-sources/source.db
00-sources/source.db-wal
00-sources/source.db-shm
00-sources/page-images/
